        },
        "flags": {"indoors": True},
        "sector": 'inside',
    },
    9772: {
        "name": 'On the Dark River',
        "desc": 'The river flows to the east under the walls of Midgaard and west\nsnaking through a dark forest.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 3200,
            "w": 9773,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9773: {
        "name": 'On the Dark River',
        "desc": 'The river continues east and west meandering through the woods.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9772,
            "w": 9774,
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True},
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9774: {
        "name": 'On the Dark River',
        "desc": 'The river continues east and west meandering through the woods. You\nhear the sounds of chopping wood far off in the distance.',
        "exits": {
            "n": 6123,
            "e": 9773,
            "w": 9775,
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True},
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9775: {
        "name": 'On the Dark River',
        "desc": 'The river continues east meandering through the woods.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9774,
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True},
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9778: {
        "name": 'Freefall',
        "desc": 'As your fingers slowly slip from the handguides you feel a sudden\neuphoria as you freefall the 200 + feet to your death.',
        "exits": {
        },
        "flags": {"no_mob": True, "_unknown_bits": [1]},
        "sector": 'mountain',
    },
    9781: {
        "name": 'On the Plains',
        "desc": 'You stand on an open expanse of grass extending in all directions. To\nthe south of you stand the might northern gates of New Thalos. East\nand west of you the grassy fields continue and north, in the distance,\nyou see a line of trees.',
        "exits": {
            "n": 9782,
            "e": 9781,
            "s": 9667,
            "w": 9781,
        },
        "sector": 'field',
    },
    9782: {
        "name": 'On the Plains',
        "desc": 'You stand on an open field of grass. The forest to the north is\ncloser but still a good distance away. To the south a small dirt\npath has been trodden into the ground heading towards New Thalos.',
        "exits": {
            "n": 9783,
            "e": 9782,
            "s": 9781,
            "w": 9782,
        },
        "sector": 'field',
    },
    9783: {
        "name": 'Edge of the forest',
        "desc": 'You stand at the edge of a huge forest. The line of trees\ncontinues as far as the eye can see to the east and west. A large\nexpanse of grass spreads out to the south.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9783,
            "s": 9782,
            "w": 9783,
        },
        "sector": 'field',
    },
    9784: {
        "name": 'Ishtar River',
        "desc": 'The river broadens even more here and the waters become murky. The\nsmell of saltwater has reached you from the east. The Dragon Sea\ncannot be far away. To the east you can see the faint outline\nof a city and to the north you see a large expanse of grass.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9785,
            "w": 9726,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9785: {
        "name": 'The river delta',
        "desc": 'This is where the river empties out into the Dragon Sea. The backrush\nof water has kicked up a lot of sand and the blue sea is stained where\nthe river empties. Looking east, all you can see is water....all the way\nto the horizon. North of here is a small dock you think you should be\nable to reach with out too much trouble. The river stretches off to\nthe west back towards New Thalos.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9786,
            "w": 9784,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9786: {
        "name": 'The Dragon Sea',
        "desc": 'You are on the clear blue seas of the Dragon Sea.\n Water extends in all directions as far as the eye\n can see. Off in the distance you think you might\n see a small dock to the north.',
        "exits": {
            "n": 9787,
            "w": 9785,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9787: {
        "name": 'The Dragon Sea',
        "desc": 'The Dragon Sea comes up along the shore here, the deep blue waters\nrolling in and crashing against the beach. To the north you see a\nsmall dock jutting out into the surf.',
        "exits": {
            "n": 9795,
            "e": 9796,
            "s": 9786,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9788: {
        "name": 'The Dragon Sea',
        "desc": 'You are on the clear blue seas of the Dragon Sea.\n Water extends in all directions as far as the eye\n can see. Off in the distance you think you might\n see a small dock to the south.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9797,
            "s": 9795,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9789: {
        "name": 'The Dragon Sea',
        "desc": 'You are on the clear blue seas of the Dragon Sea.\n Water extends in all directions as far as the eye\n can see. Off in the distance you think you might\n see a small dock to the west.',
        "exits": {
            "s": 9796,
            "w": 9795,
            "d": 9798,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9790: {
        "name": 'On a road',
        "desc": 'The people of New Thalos take great pride in the services their\ncity may provide. One of these services is the construction crews\nthat go to great lengths to keep all the roads in order. Although\nthe taxes in New Thalos are higher than other cities in the realm\nmost of the money is used for the good of the people.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9791,
            "w": 9668,
        },
        "sector": 'city',
    },
    9791: {
        "name": 'On a road',
        "desc": 'You walk along a well used road with beautiful scenery. To the north\ntall pine trees form a wall that goes on for miles. Between the road\nand the trees lies a great expanse of grassy plains. South of here,\nbeyond the river, lie the Sands of Sorrow. The road continues\neast and west.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9792,
            "w": 9790,
        },
        "sector": 'city',
    },
    9792: {
        "name": 'On a road',
        "desc": 'The Dragon Sea can be seen to the east now spreading out to unkown\nlands. The road continues east and west. To the south you hear the\nsounds of boats traveling the Ishtar delivering goods.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9793,
            "w": 9791,
        },
        "sector": 'city',
    },
    9793: {
        "name": 'On a road',
        "desc": 'This is the main land route through the land. Merchants can bring their goods\nto the coastline and have them ferried onto ships for export. Travel\nby foot west will take you through New Thalos up and over the Eastern\nMountains and down into Midgaard.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9794,
            "w": 9792,
        },
        "sector": 'city',
    },
    9794: {
        "name": 'Near the shore',
        "desc": 'The road ends here turning into a small dirt path leading down the\nbeach and onto a dock. To the north and south you see the coastline\nstretching out before you. West of here the lowlands roll up into\nhuge snow capped mountains.',
        "exits": {
            "e": 9795,
            "w": 9793,
        },
        "sector": 'city',
    },
    9795: {
        "name": 'On a dock',
        "desc": 'You stand on a simple wooden dock that acts as an extension of the road\nto the west. The dock seems to have been here for quite a long time\nbut is still sturdy. A small ladder has been built on the eastern end\nto allow easy access to and from ships.',
        "exits": {
            "n": 9788,
            "e": 9789,
            "s": 9787,
            "w": 9794,
        },
        "sector": 'inside',
    },
    9796: {
        "name": 'The Dragon Sea',
        "desc": 'You are on the clear blue seas of the Dragon Sea.\n Water extends in all directions as far as the eye\n can see. Off in the distance you think you might\n see a small dock to the west.',
        "exits": {
            "n": 9789,
            "w": 9787,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9797: {
        "name": 'The Dragon Sea',
        "desc": 'The ocean spreads out in all directions rolling gently. In the distance\nyou can see an island on the horizon. To the west you see the mainland.',
        "exits": {
            "s": 9789,
            "w": 9788,
        },
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9798: {
        "name": 'Under the dock',
        "desc": 'You are swimming underneath the dock. You can see the four wooden\npylons that support the structure. The murky water clouds your vision\nas you gaze westward, but you think you can make out an iron grating in\nthat direction.',
        "exits": {
            "w": {"to": 9799, "keyword": 'grate', "isdoor": True, "key": 1},
            "u": 9789,
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True},
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
    9799: {
        "name": 'Lair of the Ixitxachitl',
        "desc": 'Blood swirls around in the water as the Ixitxachitl devours the\nlast of its meal. Swirling around quickly as you intrude upon\nits meal the large sting ray attacks!',
        "exits": {
            "e": {"to": 9798, "keyword": 'grate', "isdoor": True},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True},
        "sector": 'noswim',
    },
}

